      "cooked": "<p>Can Kismet’s karma conquer Captain Cosmic and his comrades? Within these pages, true believers, you can find the answer!<br>\nAdvanced Kismet vs. Freedom Six Wraith, Captain Cosmic Requital, Bowman, Ra, and Omnitron-U in the Tomb of Anubis.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/783162ccf206bf8e2ec447de0fe5e40073200e99.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/783162ccf206bf8e2ec447de0fe5e40073200e99\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/783162ccf206bf8e2ec447de0fe5e40073200e99_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"h9h6wVT4wsso8wr3b49D0un81zH\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/783162ccf206bf8e2ec447de0fe5e40073200e99_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/783162ccf206bf8e2ec447de0fe5e40073200e99_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/783162ccf206bf8e2ec447de0fe5e40073200e99_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/783162ccf206bf8e2ec447de0fe5e40073200e99_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 100 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nWith a randomized start, you never know what’s going to happen, which is appropriate for Kismet. When she pulled Inconceivable Obstruction and Lady Luck on the same turn, I was in a lot of trouble. Followed by a lot of healing. The Talisman’s power is very useful in this matchup.<br>\nNext game went a lot better with a lot of burning and razor ordianances so even with a few lucky card heals, Kismet went down quickly- though just in time considering the hp of the standing heroes.</p>",
