      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"QuirkyDM\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"30083\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/48/2033_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> QuirkyDM:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Talisman’s power is very useful in this matchup.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Not gonna lie, I had to look up the card when I read this… because I never use that power.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e125821499cc8070b5086052270533c9ef93c8a7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/e125821499cc8070b5086052270533c9ef93c8a7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e125821499cc8070b5086052270533c9ef93c8a7_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"w7JN54uOiTG8yYQh2BwGa16alwz\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e125821499cc8070b5086052270533c9ef93c8a7_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e125821499cc8070b5086052270533c9ef93c8a7_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/e125821499cc8070b5086052270533c9ef93c8a7_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"392F29\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1170×2532 168 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Bowman and Omni were solid! Both in dealing damage and in destroying unwanted non-Hero cards <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/muscle.png?v=12\" title=\":muscle:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":muscle:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
