      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c6f31b44dee2b966facd5a28f55e81d97c6d73f2.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/c6f31b44dee2b966facd5a28f55e81d97c6d73f2\" title=\"20230605195617_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6f31b44dee2b966facd5a28f55e81d97c6d73f2_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20230605195617_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"snZokDpPjCihcE4Ct5EJN6ShP5o\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6f31b44dee2b966facd5a28f55e81d97c6d73f2_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6f31b44dee2b966facd5a28f55e81d97c6d73f2_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6f31b44dee2b966facd5a28f55e81d97c6d73f2_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6f31b44dee2b966facd5a28f55e81d97c6d73f2_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230605195617_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 343 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Got it just before the weekly refresh! Amazing how you can just shut down Kismet entirely with a couple Throat Jabs. I did use the Talisman power to make the Tomb not so bad, too.</p>",
